Janaka folds hands and offers his lineage --- Janaka traces descent from Nimi to Hrasvarōmā --- Janaka tells his father's crowning and forest retreat --- Sudhanvā besieges Mithilā demanding Sītā and Śiva bow --- Janaka slays Sudhanvā in open battle --- Janaka crowns Kuśadhvaja at Sāṃkāśyā --- Janaka offers Sītā to Rāma and Ūrmilā to Lakṣmaṇa --- Janaka sets wedding rites under Uttara Phalgunī